      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[19].VerticleSize
      value: 100
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[0].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[0].TextboxContent
      value: Welcome to the Equipment Menu! Here you can equip new artifacts and
        spells that will make your journey though wayward woods easier!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[1].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[1].TextboxContent
      value: "First let\u2019s take a look at the spells at your disposal. This is
        your Lightning spell section. Click and drag Thunder Shock into the open
        spell slot"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[2].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[2].TextboxContent
      value: "Great! Let\u2019s look at the wind spells next"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[3].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[3].TextboxContent
      value: Take Gale Barricade and KnockBack Wind!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[4].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[4].TextboxContent
      value: Next, let's take a look at your artifacts. Click on this tag to see
        all of them
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[5].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[5].TextboxContent
      value: Click and drag an artifact to the open spot
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[6].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[6].TextboxContent
      value: "Excellent!!! Let\u2019s start the journey! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[7].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[7].TextboxContent
      value: "In order to move, press the \u201CMove\u201D tag in this corner and
        then use W/A/S/D in order to make a path. You have six squares at your disposal.
        When you are done press confirm"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[8].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[8].TextboxContent
      value: Choose wisely since you can move only ONCE per turn
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[9].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[9].TextboxContent
      value: While moving try to collect pips(Pink floating orbs) in your way. They
        will let you cast more spells per turn. But remember you can only have a
        max of six
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[0].GoToNextTextbox
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[10].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[10].TextboxContent
      value: At the beginning of each turn you restore one pip
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[11].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[11].TextboxContent
      value: Now pick Knockback Wind and click on the Racoon in your range
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[12].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[12].TextboxContent
      value: You can end your turn by pressing this tag
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[13].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[13].TextboxContent
      value: "Let\u2019s move up to the water to finish off the last foe!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[14].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[14].TextboxContent
      value: Tree stumps around the map block your path, and prevent you from casting
        spells through them. They can also protect you from enemy attacks
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[15].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[15].TextboxContent
      value: Target the enemy in the water with Thunder Shock and see what happens!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[16].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[16].TextboxContent
      value: Electrifying! Now use Gale Barricade to prevent them from getting to
        you
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[17].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[17].TextboxContent
      value: End your turn
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[18].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[18].TextboxContent
      value: Finish them off now
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[19].HorizontalSize
      value: 700
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7882153830560901098, guid: 682e72e9987283646a573e67f1dceb2a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textBoxes.Array.data[19].TextboxContent
      value: Congratulations on the flawless win wizard!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
